cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark or its scoring harness, please cite the paper below."
title: "Reading Brazil: a Brazilian-Portuguese OCR cost-versus-accuracy benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible scoring harness for a benchmark of 14 open OCR engines on Brazilian
  documents, pairing a Brazilian-Portuguese accuracy axis with a consumer-GPU cost
  axis over forms, identity documents, clean prose, degraded scans, and an English
  control.
type: software
license: MIT
